WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.640
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I’m&nbsp;
going to explain a Horror Sci Fi film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:12.080
called “As The Gods Will,” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:21.440
At the beginning of the movie, 3 students;&nbsp;
Shun, Amaya and Ichika are shown as a voice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.440
in the background complains to god&nbsp;
about his dull and boring life.
&nbsp;

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.440
In the next scene, we see Shun along with his&nbsp;
friends in the college classroom where a doll&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:38.400
named Daruma doll has forced the students to&nbsp;
play a game. The game is Daruma-san ga Koronda,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.600
where an ugly-looking Daruma doll with only a&nbsp;
head is seen on the desk in front of the students.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.600
The doll turns around after he sings,&nbsp;
and if he finds someone moving,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:56.240
he kills them and turns them into red marbles. 
The remaining students start worrying as they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.080
unaware of the game rules and might&nbsp;
end up joining their dead friends.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:06.160
One by one their number starts decreasing. Two&nbsp;
of the boys try to open the door to escape but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:11.440
find it locked. They are caught moving&nbsp;
by the doll and are killed immediately.
&nbsp;

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:16.640
Suddenly, a gamer boy approaches everyone&nbsp;
to read the message at the back of the doll.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:21.440
The message says that the game will be over if&nbsp;
they press the button. A guy quickly runs to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:26.720
press the button but the doll turns around and&nbsp;
kills him. Suddenly, Shun notices that there’s a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:31.840
timer on the back of the doll and realizes that&nbsp;
they don't have much time left. Hearing this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:36.560
several other students run to switch it&nbsp;
off but every single one of them fails.
 
&nbsp;

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:42.800
At last, only Shun and the gamer boy remain as&nbsp;
all other students are turned into red marbles,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:47.840
making it impossible for them to reach the&nbsp;
doll without slipping. With time running out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:53.120
the gamer comes up with an idea and tells Shun&nbsp;
to use his back to jump over the dead bodies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:59.520
to press the button easily. Shun finally presses&nbsp;
the button, thus ending the game. As the survivors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:04.000
are celebrating, the doll declares Shun&nbsp;
the only winner and kills the gamer.
 
&nbsp;

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.400
The movie then cuts to the past when&nbsp;
life was boring and normal for Shun.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:13.920
He is sitting on a couch, playing video games and&nbsp;
changing channels after the game ends. At school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:18.480
he is walking with his gamer friend, who&nbsp;
suggests he ask Ichika out as she passes a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:24.080
smile to him. Ichika is another student in the&nbsp;
school who also loves to play video games. Shun&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:29.120
answers that he does not have any feelings for&nbsp;
her and sees her only as a friend. Both of them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:34.480
head towards the classroom when they meet a boy&nbsp;
being beaten up by Amaya; the school bully.
 
&nbsp;

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:40.560
Inside the classroom, Shun gets asleep and a loud&nbsp;
sound wakes him up. Just then, his teacher’s head&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:46.560
explodes and the Daruma doll appears. The events&nbsp;
at the start of the movie continue from here.
 
&nbsp;

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:51.520
At present, Shun starts praying to God to&nbsp;
return him to his boring life. The Daruma&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:57.200
doll mentions Shun as a mouse and tells him that&nbsp;
a cat is coming for him very soon. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:02.800
Ichika Akimoto approaches Shun’s classroom and&nbsp;
is horrified after seeing it's condition. 
 
&nbsp;

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:07.360
Shun asks her if she knows what's happening&nbsp;
but she says that she's as confused as he is.
&nbsp;

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:12.240
They try to call the police but find no signal.&nbsp;
They then try to flee the school but all the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:17.440
exits and doors are locked. The duo then run&nbsp;
from the scene towards the basketball court&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:22.320
where they are surprised to see some students in&nbsp;
mice costumes, who survived the daruma doll.
 
&nbsp;

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:25.520
They look at the floor and find&nbsp;
the words ‘ “fit the cat’s bell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:30.400
for it to end”. The school president then&nbsp;
orders them to wear the mice costumes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:36.160
Just then, the floor of the court opens up and&nbsp;
a gigantic plastic cat appears from beneath.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:41.920
The big cat starts gobbling the students one by&nbsp;
one,which sends everyone into a state of panic.
&nbsp;

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:45.840
Shun notices the ball-like bell with&nbsp;
a timer on it. He quickly informs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:50.000
everyone that in order to end the game,&nbsp;
the bell must be passed through the basket&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.120
placed on the cat’s neck. One of the students,&nbsp;
who is a good basketball player, shoots the bell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.120 --> 00:04:00.320
but the cat manages to catch it, and throws it&nbsp;
back at the student, killing him instantly.
 
&nbsp;

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:05.440
Shun seems to be a genius and quickly notices that&nbsp;
the cat is killing only those who are wearing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:11.440
mice costume. He then suggests everyone remove the&nbsp;
costume to which everyone complies. For a while,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:16.320
the cat remains idle but as the students start&nbsp;
celebrating, the cat devours another one.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:21.280
The students start screaming and running again&nbsp;
and Ichika falls on the floor amidst the chaos.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:26.480
Shun immediately gets into the mouse costume and&nbsp;
starts to distract the cat. He realizes that by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:31.600
wearing the costume, one can hear the voice of&nbsp;
the cat. All this time, the poor cat was just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:40.480
requesting them to scratch its back so that it&nbsp;
could sleep quietly. Shun quickly gets on its back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:45.920
and starts scratching it. He then tells the others&nbsp;
to join him and the cat finally falls asleep.
&nbsp;

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:50.640
Now that the cat is asleep, Shun grabs the&nbsp;
bell and proceeds to throw it over the hoop.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:55.120
The other students however, stop him as they&nbsp;
think that the only one who scores the bell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:58.960
will be the winner. Ultimately, they&nbsp;
all start quarreling with each other.
&nbsp;

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:03.200
As they are fighting, the cat wakes up&nbsp;
and starts attacking the students again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:08.320
Shun comes up with a plan once again. He&nbsp;
takes Ichika inside and conceals the bell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:13.360
in a regular basketball to deceive the cat. As&nbsp;
they throw the ball and are ready to celebrate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:18.720
the bell bounces on the ring but suddenly,&nbsp;
Amaya arrives in the nick of time and heroically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:24.320
scores the shot, thus ending the game.
The cat then declares that only Shun, Ichika,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:30.240
and Amaya can live. Shun asks about the fate of&nbsp;
the losers but before he gets an answer, Amaya&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:35.840
kills the remaining students. Amaya then says that&nbsp;
only the strongest will survive, which is God's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:41.360
will. Amaya approaches Shun and tells him that&nbsp;
both of them are alike as they have what it takes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:48.000
to survive. Ichika on the other hand disagrees and&nbsp;
mentions Shun being kinder, stronger, and smarter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:54.240
than Amaya. On hearing this Amaya is infuriated&nbsp;
and tries to attack her but the cat sprays a gas&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:58.800
from its mouth and knocks them all out.
In the next scene, a news channel is seen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:04.320
reporting about the incidents happening around the&nbsp;
schools as a terrorist attack. Another news report&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:09.280
shows large cubes hovering above the cities and&nbsp;
mentions the defense and the police departments&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:14.960
are yet to find any entrance into the cube despite&nbsp;
various attempts. The media also reveals that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:19.840
survivors of the incident are God’s children as&nbsp;
they are able to survive such a tough situation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:24.960
Some media and interviewers along with&nbsp;
the professor from a university are seen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:30.800
mentioning the incident as the alien invasion of&nbsp;
human existence. Next, we see a homeless person&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:36.800
repairing a damaged radio just by touching it.
Later, Shun wakes up in one of the cubes. Among&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:43.200
the other survivors he finds Takumi, his childhood&nbsp;
friend along with a shy and timid girl Tiara and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:48.960
an arrogant but intelligent student Taoka. Shun&nbsp;
is disappointed in finding himself playing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:54.880
death game again. He tries to escape but finds&nbsp;
all the doors locked. Taoka then informs him that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:59.600
the only way to escape the room is by winning it.&nbsp;
He also brags that his intelligence will lead him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:05.040
to victory. Through a screen, they are informed&nbsp;
that they have to find the keys to escape. 
 
&nbsp;

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:10.800
Just then, 4 wooden dolls enter the room. They&nbsp;
introduce themselves and the rules of the game.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:15.440
They say that each of the participants will be&nbsp;
blindfolded and the dolls will circle them singing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:20.400
songs. When the song stops, the participant&nbsp;
will have to guess which of the four floating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:26.240
Kokeshi wooden dolls is behind them within 10&nbsp;
seconds. Failing to guess correctly would result&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:31.680
in their death. However, if the Kokeshi dolls&nbsp;
lose, one of them will explode, releasing an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:36.960
answer key that will open the doors and allow the&nbsp;
survivors to go to the next level. The confident&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:42.720
Taoka goes first and Tiara second. But both of&nbsp;
them fail to answer and are ultimately killed.
&nbsp;

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:48.080
The dolls then approach Takumi next but Shun&nbsp;
insists on going first. With the help of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:52.560
intelligence, he wins the game as he was able&nbsp;
to note the difference in their voices with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:57.840
help of his phone. He then reveals that he had&nbsp;
recorded their voices when Tiara was playing.
&nbsp;

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:03.120
After the game ends, the dolls explode leaving&nbsp;
behind a key which Shun grabs. He then leaves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:09.440
the room along with Takumi. Outside, they see a&nbsp;
guy being chased by an ugly-looking doll. The guy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:14.640
approaches them and requests them to hold his hand&nbsp;
to save his life. He mentions that the dolls can't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:19.520
hurt those holding hands. They decide to help&nbsp;
him out and the doll leaves saying that he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:24.560
jealous of those whose friendship is strong.
 
Shun looks at the pendant Takumi is wearing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:29.680
and goes into a flashback. There, Takumi&nbsp;
is ready to commit suicide from a rooftop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:35.680
when she notices Shun smashing cups and glasses&nbsp;
onto a wall to release his anger. Shun then offers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:40.320
Takumi to do the same and she starts breaking&nbsp;
the crockery, which makes her feel better.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:44.560
At present, she is wearing the same&nbsp;
cup handle that Shun had offered her.
&nbsp;

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:48.400
Suddenly, they hear a girl’s voice&nbsp;
screaming from the other side.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:53.600
They run towards the scream and find Ichika&nbsp;
running away from the same dreadful doll. Shun&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.600 --> 00:09:00.320
jumps to hold her hand immediately and saves her.
Soon after, a wall erodes and reveals a doll’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:05.920
face with 7 of the key entries. Shun and his&nbsp;
group reach the place where 2 contestants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:11.360
are already waiting. They count their keys&nbsp;
but find that 3 of them are still missing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:16.560
Suddenly, Amaya appears at the scene with the&nbsp;
remaining keys and kills his companion as only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:21.920
seven of them are able to qualify for the next&nbsp;
round. When all of the 7 locks are unlocked,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:26.560
the doll face announces them as the winners&nbsp;
and it erodes backward into the wall,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:32.240
making a passage-like structure. Then, a voice&nbsp;
directs them to follow the passage by wearing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:39.040
costumes provided. Here, it is revealed that all&nbsp;
the games are telecasted all over the country.
 
&nbsp;

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:44.960
Next, the group finds themselves inside a frozen&nbsp;
room. A large polar bear enters and introduces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:50.800
himself. He mentions that he hates liars and&nbsp;
black hearted people. In the game, the contestants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:56.640
just have to do one thing: speak the truth.&nbsp;
Failing to do so will result in their death. 
&nbsp;

00:09:56.640 --> 00:10:00.880
The game begins when he asks everyone about&nbsp;
their favorite food. After they reply,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:07.120
the bear suspects someone of lying. The bear gives&nbsp;
the participants 2 minutes to present the liar.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:12.640
At first they defend their answers but later&nbsp;
all point towards the guy who answered Parsley.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:21.680
The bear then instantly stomps him to death.
For the second question, the bear asks if they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:27.520
like Shun. All of them who know Shun including&nbsp;
Takumi answer Yes and the others who don't know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:32.880
him answer No. The bear still believes that one&nbsp;
of them is lying to him and again suggests the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:38.320
remaining participants to name the liar. All&nbsp;
of the participants answer Takumi as the liar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:44.480
as Shun and Takumi were out of contact for a long&nbsp;
time. Despite Shun’s best attempts to save Takumi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:49.440
she gets killed. Devastated by the loss of&nbsp;
his friend, Shun screams that the liar and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:54.480
traitor among them is none other than the&nbsp;
white bear himself. It turns out to be true&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.480 --> 00:11:00.000
and the bear sheds his white color and reveals&nbsp;
his original color to be black. As all the lies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:04.640
are caught, the game officially ends, and the&nbsp;
survivors are taken to the last game.     
 

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:09.760
The remaining five participants are taken to&nbsp;
a temple. After the door opens, three wooden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:14.960
dolls welcome them and also congratulate them&nbsp;
for making it this far. The three of the dolls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:20.800
introduce themselves as fitness, intelligence,&nbsp;
and imagination. They reveal the last game name&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:26.320
as “Kick the can for it to end”. One of the&nbsp;
participants will be the Demon and the rest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:32.000
will be the Victims. Until the demon places the&nbsp;
can to the designated place, the victims will get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:37.280
their time to hide. The demon will then have to&nbsp;
find all the victims. He will have to name them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:42.720
after seeing their faces, after which he can&nbsp;
imprison them inside the cells. In this way, if he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:48.720
imprisons them all, and kicks the can, he will be&nbsp;
the winner. However, if a victim manages to kick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:54.240
the can, the other victims will be considered the&nbsp;
winners and the demon will lose. But, the victim&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:54.240 --> 00:12:00.480
who kicks the can, will die as the can explodes.
Then, the five take turns picking a stick,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:05.840
with the red stick going to the Demon. Amaya&nbsp;
obtains the red stick. He quickly places the can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:11.120
on the ground and starts searching for the others.&nbsp;
Two of the students are quickly captured. Ichika&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:17.120
then sacrifices herself in order to distract Amaya&nbsp;
while Shun escapes. After imprisoning Ichika,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:23.040
Amaya screams that he doesn't need to find Shun to&nbsp;
win the game. And despite Ichika’s advice to hide,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:27.440
Shun comes out wearing an armored suit,&nbsp;
with which he is hiding his face.
&nbsp;

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:33.280
Shun then tells Amaya that it is impossible for&nbsp;
him to get caught as his face is covered up. Amaya&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:38.720
finds this ridiculous and he quickly takes off&nbsp;
Shun’s helmet. As Amaya proceeds to kick the can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:44.160
and end the game, he realizes that Shun has&nbsp;
attached an iron chain to him. Shun then jumps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:49.680
into the water and starts dragging Amaya with him.&nbsp;
As Amaya struggles to pull Shun out of the water,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:54.240
he sees that Shun has removed the armor&nbsp;
and is slowly proceeding towards the can. 
&nbsp;

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:58.880
Suddenly, Amaya manages to break free&nbsp;
and runs towards the can but Shun kicks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:03.520
it first before him. They prepare for&nbsp;
the explosion but nothing happens.
&nbsp;

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:09.360
The game is finally over and the dolls declare&nbsp;
everyone winners except Amaya. They also reveal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:15.200
that the explosion was just a lie to make the game&nbsp;
even more interesting. An enraged Amaya then grabs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:20.880
one of the dolls and says that he isn't supposed&nbsp;
to die as he was chosen by God. The dolls start&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:25.680
laughing and reveal that no one was supposed&nbsp;
to die. The winners are then congratulated with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:30.800
fireworks in the sky. The dolls also provide&nbsp;
some ice creams to celebrate their success.
&nbsp;

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:36.560
While eating the ice cream, Shun finally asks&nbsp;
Ichika for a movie date and also expresses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:41.040
his feelings for her. Ichika happily&nbsp;
agrees but when their ice creams melt,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:46.160
they see something written on the sticks. The&nbsp;
dolls then reveal that despite making it this far,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:50.240
they need luck to live.
Amaya and Shun notice the words&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:56.160
‘you live’ on their sticks while the other&nbsp;
3 including Ichika find the words ‘you die’.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:56.160 --> 00:14:01.920
A doll then kills the losers as Shun watches in&nbsp;
horror while Ichika disappears into thin air.
&nbsp;

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:07.440
Shun and Amaya finally emerge from the cube,&nbsp;
where they are cheered by a large crowd.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:12.880
They are calling them God's children.
Amaya rejoices, but Shun bends down in despair,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:18.080
declaring "there is no God" after all of his&nbsp;
losses. One of the dolls corrects him, saying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:23.840
that God does exist. The movie ends as the same&nbsp;
homeless man from before is revealed to be God.
&nbsp;

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:27.920
